  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞把{F4 84 04 01 01 01 B1 07}\n　交给了伊丽莎白。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 11}确实是没有被弄脏的\n白色绒球。\n非常感谢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}曾经每逢Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ就\n狼狈逃窜的各位，\n竟然也变得如此强大了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我总算可以\n松一口气了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}顺便一提，这些绒球\n将用于正在积极筹备中的\n“天鹅绒年终聚会”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}可以配合轻快的音乐挥舞……\n可以尖声欢呼，为合体助威……\n也可以扔向迪奥……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:5",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}或是放在主人的头上……\n或是插在主人的鼻子上……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:6",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}可能性无穷无尽。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_130.bf.json:1:7",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E8 0E}那么，这是报酬。\n请收下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
